  - title: LEVEL 21 | Exact Wiring Guide
    explanation: Wire battery positive to SW1 input; SW1 output to R_CHARGE_Input;
      R_CHARGE_Output to C_STORE_Input; C_STORE_Output to battery negative. LCD A
      to C_STORE_Input, LCD B to C_STORE_Output. Set C_STORE capacitance to 0.001
      F (1000 uF), with voltage rating >= 5 V.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | SERIES RC + LCD ACROSS CAPACITOR
