  - title: LEVEL 21 | Voltage Rise & Charge Current
    explanation: 'Ideal estimates, not live measurements: R=1000 Ohm, C=0.001 F,
      tau=RC=1 s. Starting uncharged: Vcap(1 s)=3.16 V, Vcap(2 s)=4.32 V, Vcap(3
      s)=4.75 V. Initial resistor current 5 mA decays toward zero.'
    caption: PAGE 3/4 | TIME CONSTANT 1 SECOND
