  - title: LEVEL 21 | Correct Circuit & 3 Objectives
    explanation: 'Three target windows: supply 4.8-5.2 V; capacitor 3.0-4.8 V; charging
      resistor current 0.15-2.2 mA. All three overlap during the transient, so switch
      the source ON and watch. Only SparkLevelEvaluator awards completion. If solver
      updates do not satisfy targets together, adjust after live testing.'
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | LIVE MEASUREMENT REQUIRED
